==Route 104 (South)==
===Mr. Briney's house===
Return to the south side of {{rt|104|Hoenn}} and visit [[Mr. Briney]]'s cottage. Inside, you find the elderly man happily chasing his {{p|Wingull}} around the house. Speak to him, and he thanks you again for saving [[Peeko]]. After hearing of your deliveries to be made in [[Dewford Town]] and [[Slateport City]], Mr. Briney is happy to assist you. He is prepared to set sail for Dewford Town right away, but gives you a moment to prepare if necessary. When ready, you follow him and Peeko onto his ship and the trio sets off across the waves.

==Routes 105 and 106==
[[File:Hoenn Route 105 RS.png|thumb|100px|left|Route 105]]
[[File:Hoenn Route 106 RS.png|thumb|250px|Route 106]]

As [[Mr. Briney]] sails directly to [[Dewford Town]], there is no chance to fully explore the waters of Routes {{rtn|105|Hoenn}} and {{rtn|106|Hoenn}} on the first visit.
{{-}}
==Dewford Town==
[[File:Dewford Town RS.png|thumb|Dewford Town]]

[[Dewford Town]] is a tiny island town in the southern ocean. New trends are always the rage among its residents. Despite its isolation, many Trainers travel to the area to challenge the [[Dewford Gym]].

