The [[Dewford Gym]] specializes in {{type|Fighting}} Pokémon. Fighting-type moves are super effective against {{t|Dark}}-, {{t|Ice}}-, {{t|Normal}}-, {{t|Rock}}-, and {{type|Steel}} Pokémon, while Fighting-type Pokémon are weak to {{t|Flying}}- and {{type|Psychic}} moves.

The Gym is a maze of poorly-lit hallways. The buff Trainers inside hone their skills by training in total darkness. The visible area lights up more and more with each Gym Trainer that is defeated. When the [[Gym Leader]] is defeated, the lights are turned on and the building interior is fully visible.

Even with only two Pokémon, [[Brawly]] can still be a tough opponent. His {{p|Machop}} can deal increased damage by first using {{m|Leer}} to cut the target's {{stat|Defense}}. In addition, its {{a|Guts}} Ability boosts its physical {{stat|Attack}} by 50% when afflicted with a status condition. Both Machop and {{p|Makuhita}} can use {{m|Bulk Up}} to raise their {{stat|Attack}} and Defense power. As both Pokémon have relatively low {{stat|Special Defense}}, {{type|Psychic}} attacks will have the greatest effect.

